   Locations: [src/sync/entry_selector.rs:201](/work/crate/src/sync/entry_selector.rs:201), [src/sync/entry_selector.rs:743](/work/crate/src/sync/entry_selector.rs:743).


P0093    Both examples reference undefined `try_append_value_async.rs` links, while defining links named `try_append_value_sync.rs`.


P0094    **Executed evidence:** Ordinary stable and docs.rs-style nightly documentation builds emit two broken-link warnings. With `RUSTDOCFLAGS='-D warnings'`, documentation generation exits `101`. Readers cannot follow these example links.


